[{"type":"message","user":"UMRAUJY22","text":"\u003c@UMRAUJY22\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1628166272.224100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"1b8fbc06-dbb7-440d-a48b-51fee40d3422","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"40度行く心配はないな！（油断","ts":"1628162877.222900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sYqWk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e3110df-d77e-45f1-99bf-1325ef5b38ed","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"おかげさまで首冷やし続けてたら、38度台が見えてきました","ts":"1628162857.222700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":5,"users":["U782D5DF1","U7JL1UKKL","U9S4G0LJW","U013QL1RAPN","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g=A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5af01255-6528-4164-8064-5ea433bc728a","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、氷枕は用意したほうが良いです。かなり変わると思います。","ts":"1628159009.222100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K7Cs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f211770c-b6d6-459b-9f2b-a8b615be6172","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"最悪、氷水に頭突っ込んで急冷させます。","ts":"1628158842.221200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fcDax"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d79e784-5a7c-4065-9984-cfa0ba5ee375","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕の場合は熱と疼痛がありましたね。けど全然心配するほどじゃないです。なお熱が40℃近くなったら念のため脳を熱から守る手段だけ用意しとくと良いですよ。","ts":"1628158528.220200","thread_ts":"1628158259.219300","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S0pe"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"7c4519ec-19e1-43df-9d4c-a765b5d4f876","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"熱さえ乗り越えれば何とかって感じなんですね。","ts":"1628158259.219300","thread_ts":"1628158259.219300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5LPQD"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"fd0f7551-5413-418a-b13c-7327e487bff9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"喉もやられますね","ts":"1628158330.220100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E4e4Z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7f231440-c9eb-4996-a48b-32b06df009ae","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"摂食障害で頻繁に嘔吐している人、胃液で歯がボロボロになるって聞いたことがある","ts":"1628158303.219800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NuQuH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c4519ec-19e1-43df-9d4c-a765b5d4f876","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"熱さえ乗り越えれば何とかって感じなんですね。","ts":"1628158259.219300","thread_ts":"1628158259.219300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5LPQD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c218aded-1982-438f-9604-558f653df3f2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"お腹が減るとか、体痛くて動けないし、退屈とかはあるかもだけど…","ts":"1628158043.216000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bMXB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63ee57a0-cb81-41a0-950f-d396d66cd3ea","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"咳もないし余裕ですよ","ts":"1628157993.215100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U782D5DF1"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H7uw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"26d8dd44-cc3b-4da7-8b66-24e64081ef99","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"普通に風邪引くよりは軽いはず","ts":"1628157969.214300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MXLMg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e689030-e904-4d34-b27b-44d3788768b0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"だいたい2日くらいで直りますし、最悪水分だけとっとけば死にはしないし、ほんとうに熱だけなので重い風邪よりもはるかに楽なので、まぁあまり神経質にならなくて大丈夫かと。","ts":"1628157929.213700","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628157947.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B6vq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2e4224e6-63a3-4071-aa95-60b8a14fd84a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ふむ。いまもトリプタンが薬の第1選択肢みたいんだ。20年くらい変わってないか。","ts":"1628157861.212200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g6F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"629b5e07-a18f-4519-9740-b750eb60aa7d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"副作用恐ろしい…。ある程度の準備はしておいたけど足りるのだろうか…。","ts":"1628157850.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8PT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aac92f53-cacb-459e-9d7b-c8c180adcbaf","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"はい。よく混同されがちなんですが気圧のほうは発生のメカニズムが違うので、セロトニンが原因の偏頭痛のアプローチをするとかえって悪化したり違う部分に影響を与えることがあるんですよね。","ts":"1628157695.210100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+tEs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"abed793e-8680-404f-861b-d216d131bf80","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"太陽光にあたらない\u0026amp;ストレスが長く続く(きつくながいプロジェクトが続く)、で、ストレスがなくなる(プロジェクトがひと段落する)、偏頭痛発生みたいな感じ。","ts":"1628157648.209000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Wiju7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d24e7aac-ecc7-42a7-b858-2b0379bc54e5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"医療でいう偏頭痛と俗にいう偏頭痛違いますしね....(子細はわすれたので、ここではなんもいえないけど)","ts":"1628157558.207100","edited":{"user":"UAZ33BKV2","ts":"1628157653.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eF/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a889cfea-4e0f-418e-bc78-6a93899f334f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど","ts":"1628157490.205800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uvFbU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"af0b3576-2da6-47bf-8126-01f9ef7bda50","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いやセロトニン","ts":"1628157485.205600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZSwJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fe18b778-910f-4608-aef8-40fcd724f708","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"多分生れつきのものですよね","ts":"1628157457.205100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xPIo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"def12848-a675-4d66-9788-5909f740db3c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それは僕の言ってる偏頭痛じゃないんだなぁ。","ts":"1628157445.204800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HF1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c3e8be42-17c5-42ed-826c-5d7ca94bbe51","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それか酔い止めを飲む","ts":"1628157414.204400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TfK0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d9c4645-f283-4a40-a149-feea60bd8b98","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"偏頭痛(気圧がトリガー)なら耳をマッサージしたほうがいいです。","ts":"1628157403.204000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlgTo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8337ed2-5b45-4c6e-8f77-d6feaa78c703","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ええ、偏頭痛って脳内の血管の弛緩(による血流の増加)なんで、低体温の緊張状態で血管を委縮させて止めちゃう感じ。まぁダメージ残るんでその日は何もできなかったんですけども。","ts":"1628157343.203400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ScXj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d397663-c02f-49ca-aca8-ec02f9ba9fa0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこらを聞くと、昔の医療で下剤と並んで嘔吐促進があったのがわかるなあ(症状が収まるという意味で)","ts":"1628157310.202800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ROr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9797405c-7d58-435a-bbfa-250ccb7393f9","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"強制的に体温下げて血流遅くして痛み抑えるのか・・・","ts":"1628157237.200800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"unho8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1969C0F4-EA4F-492D-BC93-42F2C324DA1E","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"あ、上に書いてある方法か","ts":"1628157221.200400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iRX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78481F84-0BBA-4283-8793-B1338D5025DA","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"しりたい","ts":"1628157201.199800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cq+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06cd6782-4ba8-4688-bf80-60a207e636de","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"僕はひどい偏頭痛からの復帰方法として編み出しました。","ts":"1628157191.199600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ohEX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d138b077-8693-4661-8d97-ae8c61eb02bc","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"常温の水だと体温の方が高いから熱持ってかれるのか\nそれと体温に近いほうが刺激少ない","ts":"1628157166.199200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lvc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"181200d7-12a5-44db-8b72-3faad56e12fb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そういや輸血や輸液もあっためますっけ","ts":"1628157092.197800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b+aZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad9c4d7e-940d-4db2-8e84-9ff841075462","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"医療行為で行われる胃洗浄なんかだと、温水使うらしいですね。","ts":"1628157064.197200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628157072.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=t62"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ba72c4c-0942-482c-ad08-ec94d6b75215","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"そらぁ本来体の外側から少しずつ放出するのとは別のやり方ですからね","ts":"1628157062.197000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s06V/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b43f24b5-ac96-4513-8c11-abb3330a9eac","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"深部の強制冷却ですからねえ...","ts":"1628157038.196100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"X2H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dc40370-0d7f-4305-b8fb-39ecbb850308","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あの寒さを体験しちゃうと、いわゆる水風呂がぬるく感じるという。","ts":"1628157012.195500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Vmm="}]},{"client_msg_id":"d9a30004-4d54-4813-b55e-bf235ae1ead7","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"嘔吐にかなり嫌悪感が強いので(いろいろあった)、そうそうできないな...","ts":"1628157001.195200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wlUo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"859fcf95-f538-4016-b3dd-984e4e006e32","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"大卒で就職した先で飲み会やたらあったんで\n吐くやり方は覚えてる","ts":"1628156994.195000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"657"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11cd0112-6878-41a0-b6d4-c72ec5b0eda1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"今度機会があったら一度試してみよう","ts":"1628156957.193900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0tQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b546d51-40c0-4c91-ba68-fe9f28497bb5","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ガタガタ震えがくるくらい冷えますよ。","ts":"1628156917.193000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dce=0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d77bf524-c185-478d-81c0-ce282cbdb99a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"スレッドに書きましたけどまさにそれ。","ts":"1628156907.192600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fw7uL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66bb7827-3500-4d5f-99da-89b1b1db0657","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"水飲んで吐くのか","ts":"1628156889.192200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"50kTm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"915f64b7-ee81-4543-a36b-83e1b6389713","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"水飲んでは吐いてを繰り返すとか？","ts":"1628156886.191800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]},{"name":"hiee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UES"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d6916cd-b229-4bee-b89f-a03f560b76a1","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あと急激に体温を落とす裏ワザがあるんですけど、それ使うには自分の意志で吐ける必要がある。","ts":"1628156847.191200","thread_ts":"1628156847.191200","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nmv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"635ad5d3-c219-4ce3-b646-644de906b8fa","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"緊急用に巨大なアイスノンを冷凍庫に突っ込んでるけど何度か役に立ってる","ts":"1628156656.190600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1FB3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1c03e4d-7be7-41cc-8e94-a40cdf708fa2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"わきの下とかで計測できる熱は下がらなくても大丈夫です。熱に弱いのは脳だけなので。","ts":"1628156589.189300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["UFBGUPDP0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"igZT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41e868d2-ec88-4739-b969-6728c34d9385","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"積極的に首冷やしてはいるんですが、効果が一切感じられなかったので諦めかけてたけど、諦めずやってみます","ts":"1628156522.188400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/f1Gc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7da47506-960f-4252-82a4-8ef08698042e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみに計測では僕も39.5℃まで行ってたんで、おそらく40℃にはなってたと思います。解熱鎮痛剤(イブプロフェン)は39.5℃になってから飲み始めました。","ts":"1628156203.187400","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628156213.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2TcDx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cc6848c-b064-46ac-a623-da81be015292","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとはとりあえず濡れタオルで首回り(動脈)冷やすことで、脳を熱から守ると良いです。","ts":"1628156123.186500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1628156134.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sqop1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57dba266-f330-41e8-b16e-d38210788f15","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれは「冷感」なんですよ。もちろんゼリーが持ってる水分が揮発することでさがる温度もあるけど微々たるもの。","ts":"1628156086.185800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EYw6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4fdc363-bdee-4c36-8853-94abd0c41d1d","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"なるほど","ts":"1628156057.185100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n+u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fdc8b85-39c4-4393-bc1c-56dc31bd4311","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"冷えピタが冷えないってなんか禅問答みたい","ts":"1628156052.184800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p/HKO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a41b5db5-10f2-45c7-98aa-361da6a0e8b3","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"急ぎならヒヤロン。そうでないならケーキとかの保冷剤を凍らせてかな。","ts":"1628156051.184700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"//me"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1494a4f-a034-4c13-9ea7-755ba7987261","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"お、じゃあ不要ですかね","ts":"1628155971.183300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gM+=z"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aac6de90-2205-4e03-81f8-f3b0a00cb2ca","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そうそうヒエピタは実際には冷えないから。","ts":"1628155960.183000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V0UQA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91CF0445-431F-43D3-AE74-84CBBE82561B","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"39めっちゃキツそう","ts":"1628155778.181600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EU85"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d029372-fe44-4bc4-aad1-1b9190b320fc","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"セルフ差し入れ失敗\n冷えピタだけ除外されて何事もなかったかのように続けられてしまったｗ","ts":"1628155614.181100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rJtn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d92ccf50-49a0-41c0-9906-23afba57d46a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"信玄さんみたく水風呂にはいらんといかん、となりそう...\n冷えピタは冷えるわけではないらしいので注意ね","ts":"1628155552.180200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"S/swL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d1048949-cfc9-4e9b-9ff2-6a4dad6e6ce8","type":"message","user":"UFBGUPDP0","text":"解熱剤限界量いってしまったけど、副反応で39度以上をキープし続けてうーん\nもう下げれないので、このままだと40度とかいきそうでまずい\nウーバーで冷えピタとポカリが買えそうなのは良いですねー　現代のセルフ差し入れ","ts":"1628155405.179100","edited":{"user":"UFBGUPDP0","ts":"1628155438.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"odaijini","count":6,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","U06BRP8VD","U017BU3UZBQ","U81LLJ340","U01R5R36QK0","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"82VCm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43a8547e-bf5f-4a34-9bd3-5d8047b6fd57","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"水道水を500ml～1Lくらいのんでは吐くを繰り返すとあっという間に冷えます。ガタガタ震えるくらい。","ts":"1628156888.192000","thread_ts":"1628156847.191200","parent_user_id":"U06BRP8VD","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bkQ"}]}]
